  {
   "code": "value-is-face-value-declared",
   "detail": "5 holding(s) carry units and NO market value, because the SCRIP NAME declares this face value and the printed value divided by the balance is exactly it. A depository records the value a security was allotted at where it has no price for it, and multiplying by that produces a valuation nobody struck — National Stock Exchange of India Ltd at Re 1 a share is the plainest case. Rows: ELECTROMECH INFRAPROJECTS LIMITED - EQ NEW FV RS.5/- (378788 at 5.0000); EVEREST FLEET PRIVATE LIMITED - EQ NEW FV RS. 1/- (710 at 1.0000); INTEGRIS MEDTECH LIMITED - EQ NEW FV RE.1/- (177981 at 1.0000); NATIONAL STOCK EXCHANGE OF INDIA LTD - EQ NEW FV RE.1/- (125000 at 1.0000); RADIANT INNOVATIVE MANUFACTURING LIMITED - EQ NEW FV RS. 10/- (71400 at 10.0000)."
  },
  {
   "code": "value-is-face-value-scheme",
   "detail": "2 holding(s) carry units and NO market value, because the identifier is an `INF` fund or AIF scheme and the implied price is exactly a unit's issue price, never a NAV. A depository records the value a security was allotted at where it has no price for it, and multiplying by that produces a valuation nobody struck — National Stock Exchange of India Ltd at Re 1 a share is the plainest case. Rows: INDIA SME INVESTMENTS AIF TRUST II - CL A2 - Restricted Transferability (67500 at 1000.0000); SKY CAPITAL RISING TITANS FUND I - SKYCRTF ONCAREA3 - Restricted Transferability (15000 at 1000.0000)."
  },
  {
   "code": "value-is-face-value-par",
   "detail": "17 holding(s) carry units and NO market value, because the implied price is exactly a face-value denomination with no paise, on a name that declares none. A depository records the value a security was allotted at where it has no price for it, and multiplying by that produces a valuation nobody struck — National Stock Exchange of India Ltd at Re 1 a share is the plainest case. Rows: ASSETGRO FINTECH PRIVATE LIMITED - 1% SERIES B PREF 25NV44 (636 at 10.0000); BIG BANG BOOM SOLUTIONS PRIVATE LIMITED - 0.001% PREF 12SP44 (48 at 10.0000); ESDS SOFTWARE SOLUTION LIMITED - EQ NEW FV RS .1/- (330898 at 1.0000); EVEREST FLEET PRIVATE LIMITED - 0.001% SERIES B NEW PREF 18AP43 (100 at 1.0000); INFOBAY AI LIMITED - 0.01% PREF 18AG44 (107 at 10.0000); INNOVITI TECHNOLOGIES PRIVATE LIMITED - EQ (32017 at 10.0000); MATRIX GAS AND RENEWABLES LIMITED - EQ (75000 at 10.0000); OILMAX ENERGY PRIVATE LIMITED - EQ (17000 at 10.0000); ONIX RENEWABLE LIMITED - EQ (90000 at 10.0000); RAYS POWER EXPERTS PRIVATE LIMITED - EQ (59000 at 10.0000); SKS FASTENERS LIMITED - EQ (24800 at 10.0000); SOTEFIN BHARAT LIMITED - EQ (171879 at 10.0000); SPRAY ENGINEERING DEVICES LIMITED - EQ (165566 at 10.0000); URB VENTURES PRIVATE LIMITED - 0.001% PREF 07JL42 (4000 at 10.0000); URB VENTURES PRIVATE LIMITED - EQ (148000 at 10.0000); WEVOIS LABS PRIVATE LIMITED - EQ (55 at 10.0000); ZENITH LEISURE HOLIDAYS LIMITED - EQ (32791 at 10.0000)."
